    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/RhythmMMO_Logo2.png?t=1704264101\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your journey lies ahead - It all begins with a simple tap to the funky beat of RhythmMMO!</h2><br><br>In a world befallen by tragedy, the only way to restore happiness is to <strong>dig and fight to the beat</strong>. Welcome to <strong>RhythmMMO</strong>, a world filled with funky beats and bittersweet tales, where a continuous stream of music guides your every move.<br><br>This massively multiplayer genre mashup combines the open nature and creativity of <strong>sandbox games</strong> with the exhilarating pace-keeping of <strong>rhythm games</strong>. Every action you take will require staying in lockstep with the music\u2019s tempo. Whether you need to <strong>dig for treasure and resources</strong> or approach and <strong>attack foes</strong>, your ability to stay in the flow will be key to <strong>unlocking the secrets</strong> of this world and restoring balance.<br><br>Engage with the three factions of the <strong>Bermuda Triangle</strong>, each with its own motivations and influences. Explore a world where magic and technology both blend and clash. Master pulsating rhythms as you take on the gods themselves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/e825bd74ec463aae544a2c43279e62db.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Groove to the beat </strong><br>Experience exciting rhythm gameplay that will keep you on your toes as you hit the beats with precision and style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/e16091d650e931fdfa4e34665d07e7f3.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Forge your fate</strong><br>Unleash your creativity with a robust crafting system that allows you to forge powerful items and create unique treasures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/43f15afb2215f8d6ec7fef52e97b0a82.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Express your creativity</strong><br>Shape the world to your liking with sandbox terrain destruction, where you can carve, dig, and mold the environment to suit your desires.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/29a0f042ed6d21c35ef641349fe1d331.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Build your home</strong><br>Build your dream home and decorate it to perfection, creating a cozy and personalized sanctuary.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/93bdee46aa1cf7737867fbc11999105b.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Restore balance</strong><br>Engage in challenging gameplay as you cancel anomalies to restore creatures and objects back to their normal state, fostering a wholesome and caring atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/03580779bca29bbec4507108ad16ea43.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Get Cozy</strong><br>Dive into adorable and charming graphics filled with cute animals and larger-than-life creatures, all while enjoying a forgiving and wholesome gameplay experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/7567fabbb132ac67187506645220ab8b.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Unveil the truth </strong><br>Immerse yourself in a captivating main storyline that delves into the dynamic between nature and nurture, posing thought-provoking questions along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/f51f5cd0ec5e06b2655499d535a15bf3.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Personalize your character</strong><br>Show off your unique style with options that allow you to customize your gear, clothes, and appearance to your heart's content.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/561978e14b02be402d93f3c13a631068.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Design your own items</strong><br>Express your creativity further by designing custom items, from gear to furniture, within the game, making your mark on the world with your own creations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/8cbfd699993834c9f9e4f7ae9dcc9b86.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><strong>Choose your path</strong><br>Choose from the three faction classes of the Ternion, each offering distinct playstyles and motivations, adding depth and variety to your gameplay experience.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/arrow0.png?t=1704264101\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/c4c98b8e645eb6b7fb9b88f2f61b3742.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/952d48b23b023cfc6e185df09d91c0cf.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/70e0e7b58b952aac06c8e5c87c8f55a8.avif?t=1704264101\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487590/extras/RhythmMMO_Logo2.png?t=1704264101\" /></span>",
